// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Desdemona_the_Glint 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Desdemona the Glint 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3677268808" "Desdemona the Glint"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3985979938" "Desdemona is without a doubt Cap au Diable's snappiest dresser. She has more 'Best Dressed' awards than she has diamonds, and that's saying something. Those diamonds are how she got her nickname. When the light shines on her, she 'glints'."
// HelloString :
"P3023319717" "Hey sugar. I don't have anything exciting for you now, but come back when you've finished your business and we can talk."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3291351058" "Sorry, sweetie. I only work with the fabulously well-dressed. Maybe you should talk to Boris the Russian. He seems more your--style."
// FirstVisitString :
"P799215233" "Well hello, good-looking. I love your costume. What a fabulous fashion-sense you have! In fact, I like you so much I'll let you in on a little secret. You go out there and do your own thing, and when I hear about certain jobs going down around town, I'll put a coded message in the Newspaper for you to come see me. Dig?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3571799939" "I'm afraid this town's dead right now, {VillainName}. Check back later and I'll let you know if anything's happening."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3069765524" "Woah! Slow down, tiger! You're too busy for me right now. When you've finished some of your own schemes I'll probably have something for you though."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3150483338" "I have something for you, hon, but you need a little more bling. Come back when you're Threat Level 10."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P80562085" "You're movin' up in the world, {VillainName}. Now if we could just do something about your look."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2450489725" "You're the talk of the town, {VillainName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1767752487" "Desdemona the Glint is a real character. She's also quite a looker, and tapped into just about everything that's going on in Cap. You can't miss her. She's the one with all the bling. Bet you can guess where she gets it."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4138859679" "Choose Desdemona the Glint"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2828808063" "You'll enjoy getting to know Desdemona. Just remember that beneath that dazzling package is a heart as hard as diamonds."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


