// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Kara_the_Scorpion 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Kara the Scorpion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P3171521994" "Kara the Scorpion"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3446303892" "Kara was a top-notch assassin before she suffered a crushing defeat by Statesman. Her body has never been the same, so now she brokers information from her criminal contacts and shares it with super-powered operatives--like you."
// HelloString :
"P3925439697" "It is easier to pluck a single apple than to pick a tree. Return when you have finished your own schemes and I will see if we have something more to discuss."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P92633576" "There are many choices on the path to enlightenment. Yours lies with Mickey the Filch."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2626163892" "My name is Kara. I am called the Scorpion because I am quick to sting those who cross me. If you can make a name for yourself on this wretched isle, I might share some of my tips with you. I can no longer partake in the great game myself--Statesman himself saw to that when he broke my spine--but my former employers often pass on lucrative tips for a small cut of the proceeds. <br><br><b>Since you're playing in the big leagues now, you'll have to do a lot more to earn my respect. I'd say five jobs should earn you a heist.</b>"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P900174541" "The patient bird chirps only when there is silence. Check back later and I'll let you know if anything's happening."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P4163690751" "You must capture the wind before you can ride it. Finish your own tasks and we will discuss further business."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P466979588" "The novice does not enter the dojo without permission. You are not yet skilled enough for my clients. Come back when you're Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P577651308" "A strong reed bends before it breaks. I admire your progress, {VillainName}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P929960157" "Even the alpha wolf begins life as a pup. Congratulations, {VillainName}. My clients are very pleased with your progress here on Sharkhead Isle."
// LocationString :
"P1026847326" "Sharkhead"
// IntroString :
"P1503976170" "Kara's former career made her a lot of friends. Most of the enemies she made aren't around anymore."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P880597628" "Choose Kara the Scorpion"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4039613772" "Kara is as beautiful as she is dangerous. You'd best keep that in mind."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


