"P1142121509" "Newspaper"
// ProfessionString :
"P450856646" "Newspaper"
// DescriptionString :
"P2960714054" "The Rogue Isle Protector"
// HelloString :
"P2565345014" "The following items catch your attention."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4113466799" "You need to get the newspaper from your Broker."
// FirstVisitString :
"P660190924" "firstvisitstring."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1380846079" "While looking for today's headlines, you see {BrokerName} has planted a secret message just for you. It says to stop by for a tip on a really big job."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P822969749" "You've got enough to handle now. Maybe you can check the news again after you finish your other schemes."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2959205378" "Things here seem a little too difficult for you. Perhaps after you've proven yourself some more and attained a higher Threat Level you could return."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P595920475" "relationshipchangestring."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2736134398" "relationshipchangetoconfidant"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P257857242" "The events here seem to be beneath your notice."
// LocationString :
"P1765342107" "Rogue Isles"
// IntroString :
"P2719678188" "You should check out the newspaper."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P688064606" "Choose Newspaper"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P568641003" "<color deepskyblue>Now that you've been introduced to your Broker, you can start scanning the Rogue Isles Protector, the local newspaper, for things going on in your current zone. You can then act on one of your 'Schemes' by selecting it from the newspaper, listed under your Contacts. <br><br>After every 3 successful Schemes, your Broker will  tip you off to Heists and other special missions, as well as introduce you to new Contacts with stories and missions of their own.</color>"
// IntroduceOneContact :
