// Name :
"P120040033" "Stella the Mouth"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P3969253344" "Stella never lost her groove, or her big mouth. She's not known for keeping secrets, but the truth is she knows far more than she ever tells. Keep her on your good side and she'll share with you. Cross her and everyone out there will know where you live and what you ate for breakfast."
// HelloString :
"P3076443866" "Aren't you looking fine, {VillainName}! Things are going well. Keep it up."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4288589648" "I don't think you're in the right place. Something tells me you're more of a Winston the Gent type."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3945610179" "Hello, hon. I'm Stella the Mouth. Don't let that scare you off though. I can keep a secret if you're on my good side. They call me the Mouth because I'm tapped into everything going on around here, and as soon as I find out something I think you'll care about, I'll be happy to share it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P773940012" "Things are a little slow right now. I'd tell you if they weren't. They don't call me the Mouth for nothing."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3284499029" "Ooh. You're way too busy for me, {VillainName}. Come back when you've cleared your plate a little. I'll tell you everything I know when I something worth telling."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P2028199342" "Hmm. You're a little small-time for me just yet. Come back when you're Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2122603109" "You're making some waves out there, {VillainName}. That's good. Keeps your price up."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3430824969" "Sh! Hear that? That's the chatter on the street. And it says you're doing fine."
// LocationString :
"P2567045917" "Nerva"
// IntroString :
"P530488266" "Stella is tapped into the scene around Nerva, though some thinks she plays both sides of the fence. Some of her friends are Longbow agents. Is she milking them for information, or setting you up?"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2645605802" "Choose Stella the Mouth"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3635843453" "Stella will tell you everything she hears. That's why they call her the 'Mouth'."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


