// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Wiggy the Brit 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P991397799" "Wiggy the Brit"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P2882199451" "Wiggy the Brit was once part of the London underground, knowing what was going down all over that British metropolis. Unfortunately, his fame became too great and he was sought after as an accessory to various crimes around the city, and was forced to flee to the Rogue Isles. Thanks to his ingenuity and charm, he easily managed to set himself as the one and only go-to guy in Grandville."
// HelloString :
"P3274417924" "'Ello, me ol' mucka! How's the life of crime and villainy workin' out for you? I've got nothing new for you right now. Maybe try back after tea time?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P709834938" "We haven't been introduced. I'm Wiggy the Brit. Pleased to meet you, <VillainName>."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3395887886" "'Ello, mate. You must be {VillainName}. I've heard a lot about you. Quite a bit of trouble you've caused, ey what? If you're looking for more, you've come to the right place. I'm Wiggy the Brit, and if you want to know what's going on in Grandville, I'm your man."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3203048370" "Sorry, mate. The little birdies aren't chirping right now. When I hear something, you'll be the first to know."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2028434477" "Sounds like you've got a full slate right now, mate. Come back when you've got some free time and we'll chat."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4025271883" "Sorry, mate. I only deal with real players. Threat Level {Level} and up, y'see."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P686726255" "You're rattlin' some heads around here, {VillainName}. Nice work! Keep it up and you'll be in all the rags before you know it!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2004696345" "The buzz in Grandville is that {VillainName} is really on the rise. Keep it up and we'll both be living champagne wishes and caviar dreams."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P127847879" "You're outta my league, {VillainName}. And that's saying something since I handle all the way up to Threat Level {Level}. What'd you do, hack the game?"
// LocationString :
"P3340683840" "Grandville"
// IntroString :
"P674400740" "Wiggy knows how to work the streets without catching the attention of Recluse and his lieutenants. He's the perfect source for you to continue your career in crime here in Grandville."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2014617012" "Choose Wiggy the Brit"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P50669445" "Wiggy isn't much of a threat, but his friends are, so play nice. For now."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
