// Name :
"P3923917688" "Winston the Gent"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1852858230" "Winston is that rare thief. One of breeding and education. He's used his advantages and the guise of a butler to network with service staff all over the city. You'd be surprised what even the most close-mouthed crime lord will say in front of a maid he doesn't think speaks English."
// HelloString :
"P3762702588" "Hip hip, {VillainName}! Keep up the good work."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1356682489" "Perhaps you would prefer to speak with someone more...suitable to your breeding. May I recommend Stella the Mouth?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P531602318" "Oh, hello {VillainName}! Terribly nice to meet you. I'm called Winston the Gent by you yanks. I suppose anyone with a sense of manners in this place is a 'gentleman.' I happen to own a cleaning service, and you'd be surprised the access we get. Perhaps we can find a way to capitalize on them, you and I."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1417253437" "Things seem a bit quiet now, but return soon. Things will pick up."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P662503347" "Tut tut. You're far too busy to take on new assignments. Come back when you've completed some of your other tasks."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1347360386" "Terribly sorry, but I only deal with operatives of at least Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3578005556" "Cheerio, {VillainName}! You're performing smashingly!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2897026443" "The rabble are afraid of you. That's a good thing. It is far better to be feared than loved here in the Rogue Isles."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1123908768" "Winston the Gent is known for his immaculate dress. His assignments are similarly solid."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P4181053691" "Choose Winston the Gent"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1796569793" "Winston will take care of you like your own personal servant."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
